  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/VaquesSueraDijous.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(51 fotos) Suera es troba ja a la recta final de les festes d&#39;agost, que acabaran aquest diumenge 20. Dijous han hagut vaques de la ramaderia de Juan Faet, de vesprada, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/BouEmbolatSueraDijous.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>l&#39;embolada d&#39;un bou del mateix ferro, despr&eacute;s de la cagada del manso, que va ser a les 23 hores, mentre molta gent encara estava sopant.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2307.jpg\" alt=\"img_2307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2309.jpg\" alt=\"img_2309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2310.jpg\" alt=\"img_2310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2311.jpg\" alt=\"img_2311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2314.jpg\" alt=\"img_2314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2315.jpg\" alt=\"img_2315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2319.jpg\" alt=\"img_2319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueras17bousdijous/img_2330.jpg\" alt=\"img_2330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"